  "title": "The Prince's Strategist",
  "subtitle": "\"Valen and I were seven years old when we swore the first oath. We were twenty-seven when the king said he was marrying Valen to a foreign duke's daughter.\"",
  "penName": "Aiden Frost",
  "genre": "blMm",
  "hook": "Prince Valen of Avelon and I grew up in the same palace, the same library, the same swordsmanship hall. We swore oaths of protection and honesty at seven and kept them at fourteen and at twenty-one. I became his strategist. He became the heir. I became the man who stood at his right hand at every council meeting, every treaty signing, every Wolf's Day feast. I had been in love with him for twenty years and had told no one. On the morning the king announced Valen's betrothal to Lady Imara of Kirat, I did not move.",
